      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but the breaks dont really work for me cuz once i stop i lose the momentum completely lol. like i feel like i need that extra edge to stay productive for like 6-8 hours straight. if i just take a caffeine pill with my ritalin dose would that be fine? i just want to make sure i can stay dialed in without feeling too shaky.",
